endobj
1022 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 558 0 R
/E (They reject temporary "painkillers." What they need is cognitive enlightenment: Why do they react that way? Where is the root of the problem? The solution must dissect the psychological mechanisms rather than just treating surface symptoms.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1023 0 obj
