/K [7]
>>
endobj
1024 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 558 0 R
/E (When seeking advice, deep inside they often already have a hidden/implicit decision. They do not need a novel direction, but rather alignment to confirm that their thoughts are reasonable, from which they gain the courage to take action themselves.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1025 0 obj
<<
